  "releaseNotes": "refactor(core): decouple Roslyn source generators to LuciferCore.Platforms\n\n      BREAKING CHANGE: Completely stripped Roslyn source generator analyzer references and packaging targets from LuciferCore to establish a pure low-level engine footprint.\n\n      - Removed LuciferCore.Generators project reference and analyzer targets from Core.\n      - Transferred source generation pipeline and automated scaffolding to LuciferCore.Platforms.\n      - Cleaned up NuGet packaging targets (removed PackGeneratorsIntoNuget).\n      - Reduced compilation overhead and analyzer footprint within the Core compilation pipeline.\n      - Bumped version to 6.1.2.",
